{{wikipedia}}
==English==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|el}} {{term|δενδρίτης|tr=dendrites||of or pertaining to a tree|sc=Grek}}.

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{cytology}} A slender projection of a [[nerve cell]] which conducts [[nerve impulse]]s from a [[synapse]] to the body of the cell; a [[dendron]].
# {{cytology}} Slender cell process emanating from the cell bodies of dendritic cells and follicular dendritic cells of the immune system.
# {{crystallography|metallurgy}} tree-like structure of crystals growing as material crystallizes

